{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい。!りさちゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN26TY82M80GGH78ZYKH9D9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年明けてからのりさちゃーん、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ゲームセンターにねるといってクレーンゲームを物凄く本気でしました(﹡ˆωˆ﹡)\nたくさん取れてねると抱き合って感激しました。\nあれこれ書いたっけ。?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近朝が寒すぎて。動けなくなる〜〜。寒さに負けないようにがんばろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN26WNEQZ9DJFN82WKS3GYR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"}],"source":"archive"}